{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hNHm8vYymx1794903754.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》現正熱播，由陳自瑤（Yoyo）飾演的「關子盈」作為全劇關鍵靈魂人物，她的遭遇不僅牽動觀眾情緒，更成為好姊妹「夏無雙」（楊茜堯飾）踏上復仇之路的重要導火線。為配合劇集熱播，陳自瑤日前於社交平台分享多張絕美造型照造勢，並發文與粉絲互動：「如果要用一種玫瑰去形容「她」我會選擇白玫瑰🤍🌹你呢？」</p><p><p><img alt=\"chenchiyiu_1794893200_4032171417369783595_631179648.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EXnG9xBu0f1794903695.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>曝光的相片中，陳自瑤以一身純白仙氣造型亮相，上身穿著一字領露肩粗花呢束腰設計上衣，布料上點綴著細緻亮片，下身配襯輕盈浪漫的白色薄紗長裙，加上精緻的白色花瓣耳環與俐落盤髮，既展現出白滑香肩與鎖骨線條，亦流露出一份純潔溫柔的氣質，與「白玫瑰」的意象不謀而合。</p><p><p><img alt=\"chenchiyiu_1794893200_4032171427696001564_631179648.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026It0JBIG6Fp1794903710.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"chenchiyiu_1794893200_4032171380258613280_631179648.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lCtOQ6eMey1794903717.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T02:03:48.104289+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T01:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T06:57:15.729308+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T01:57:10.139724+00:00","content_hash":"8b49d1b29e46d6a2ef52df8891eaa4c3a355c69618b0a479d3bb974e62d5e82c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T02:03:48.104289+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}